{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本和美國明日起舉行大型軍演，日本的25式陸基長程反艦導彈從熊本基地出發，準備參加軍演。</p><p></p><p>四輛發射車當地周日早上出發，前往參加星期一舉行、代號「利劍」的軍演。25式導彈是日本國產導彈，據報射程約1,000公里，覆蓋中國沿海部分地區，今次會是這款導彈3月部署以來，首次參與大規模演習，但不會進行實彈射擊。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.MISSILE-1830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AhCXrKFuv81792318374.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>是次演習將持續至29日，在日本各地舉行，共約6萬兵力參加。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:59:03.344093+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T14:17:47.544243+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:57:38.548619+00:00","content_hash":"20d5f6ff4cd3d979988cbb65d773e1f6c0adfbd2ad311b323db5c2045ff106d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}